        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076470/extras/7a09870cab22842906986cfa1293de32.avif?t=1787535849\" width=1291 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little girl and her big sister live in a house surrounded by a huge farm. The big sister likes to grow potatoes. However, the little girl prefers to collect apples. Her dream is to be able to make dishes shared with the general public from her apples... when they will grow in her apple tree, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her big sister has to go away for a while, the little girl is left to her own. To not get bored, she wants to try to imitate her big sister by growing the same potatoes and taking them to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076470/extras/76a00233879c23be31cee042d5a76808.avif?t=1787535849\" width=1291 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ~40k words of text</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Story about a cute girl who loves apples</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Kinetic storyline with no choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Identity crisis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story, programming, art: Gud91</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Mock Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076470/extras/7a09870cab22842906986cfa1293de32.avif?t=1787535849\" width=1291 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little girl and her big sister live in a house surrounded by a huge farm. The big sister likes to grow potatoes. However, the little girl prefers to collect apples. Her dream is to be able to make dishes shared with the general public from her apples... when they will grow in her apple tree, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her big sister has to go away for a while, the little girl is left to her own. To not get bored, she wants to try to imitate her big sister by growing the same potatoes and taking them to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076470/extras/76a00233879c23be31cee042d5a76808.avif?t=1787535849\" width=1291 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• ~40k words of text</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Story about a cute girl who loves apples</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Kinetic storyline with no choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Identity crisis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story, programming, art: Gud91</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: Mock Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
